# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Common: Docker Compose and Kubernetes
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# IT-Tools has no persistent server-side data, no DB, and no configurable env
# vars — everything runs client-side in the browser. This file exists only so
# the service follows the same cp .env.example .env convention as every other
# service. Nothing to fill in.

